Reuse an owned residue slot when both encoder modes configure the same number.
The 5.1 short and long mappings both select LFE residue2. Reinitializing its
plain-data structure preserves the final configuration without losing the
previous allocation; vorbis_info_clear remains the single owner cleanup.

--- a/thirdparty/libvorbis/vorbisenc.c
+++ b/thirdparty/libvorbis/vorbisenc.c
@@ -461,5 +461,5 @@

-  vorbis_info_residue0 *r=ci->residue_param[number]=
-    _ogg_malloc(sizeof(*r));
+  vorbis_info_residue0 *r=ci->residue_param[number];
+  if(!r)r=ci->residue_param[number]=_ogg_malloc(sizeof(*r));

   memcpy(r,res->res,sizeof(*r));
